@baseUrl = http://localhost:5287

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/ping
Accept: application/json

### Process liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Neon PostgreSQL, Redis, MinIO, SMTP readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Development OpenAPI
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Admin user list (requires an authenticated Admin)
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-access-token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
